27;/%3E%3Cpath class=&#x27;opacity-75&#x27; fill=&#x27;%23d1d5db&#x27; d=&#x27;M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4zm2 5.291A7.962 7.962 0 014 12H0c0 3.042 1.135 5.824 3 7.938l3-2.647z&#x27;/%3E%3C/svg%3E&quot;);background-position:center;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-size:24px;transition:background 0.2s"/></picture></a></div><div class=""><p class="uppercase pt-2 pb-2 lg:pb-4"><b>Simplicity Teas</b></p><div class="pb-4 flex-1 leading-loose mb-4 dynamic-content"><p>After much throughout searching, price, and quality comparison for custom-designed boxes, we decided to go with PackMojo! Communication throughout the process was great, customer service was top-notch, and we have already recommended people to them because I was impressed with everything! Already looking forward to re-ordering!</p>
