etail of your packaging is yours to design.","link":null,"columnCssOverride":null,"imageCssOverride":null,"icon":"sliders-horizontal","image":null},{"id":2576,"title":"Sustainable by Default","content":"FSC-certified materials, recycled content, and soy-based inks. Premium packaging that respects the planet.","link":null,"columnCssOverride":null,"imageCssOverride":null,"icon":"sprout","image":null},{"id":2577,"title":"Expert Guidance","content":"Tailored recommendations from packaging specialists who understand your products and brand vision.","link":null,"columnCssOverride":null,"imageCssOverride":null,"icon":"headphones","image":null}],"__component":"sections.multi-column"},{"id":88,"title":"How it works","subTitle":"Three simple steps from idea to finished product.","layout":"horizontal","showConnectors":true,"showNumbers":true,"textColor":"default","backgroundColor":"light","size":"standard","contentAlignment":"center","navigationTitle":null,"steps":[{"id":429,"title":"Choose \u0026 Customize","content":"Browse 40+ packaging types. Pick your box style and customize dimensions, materials, printing, and finishing.","icon":null},{"id":430,"title":"Sample \u0026 Approve","content":"Receive a physical sample of your custom packaging. Make refinements until it's perfect.","icon":null},{"id":431,"title":"Produce \u0026 Deliver","content":"We handle production, quality checks, and worldwide shipping. Ready in 12–16 business days (plus shipping).","icon":null}],"__component":"sections.steps"},{"id":1658,"title":"For growing brands \u0026 enterprises","content":null,"imagePosition":"left","imageDirection":"column","textColor":"default","backgroundColor":"white","size":"standard","imagesExpandable":false,"imageColumnSize":6,"imagesBeforeTextOnMobile":false,"imageCssOverride":null,"forceHighQuality":false,"navigationTitle":"Who We Serve","subTitle":"Robust solutions and dedicated support that scale with your growth.","actions":[],"images":[{"id":844,"name":"peace-x-piece-puzzles-premium-rigid-boxes-flatlay.jpg","alternativeText":"Peace x Piece Puzzles Premium Rigid Boxes Flatlay","caption":"","width":1450,"height":1088,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"name":"thumbnail_peace-x-piece-puzzles-premium-rigid-boxes-flatlay.jpg","hash":"thumbnail_peace_x_piece_puzzles_premium_rigid_boxes_flatlay_71f49532ec","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","width":208,"height":156,"size":8.68,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/thumbnail_peace_x_piece_puzzles_premium_rigid_boxes_flatlay_71f49532ec.jpg"},"large":{"name":"large_peace-x-piece-puzzles-premium-rigid-boxes-flatlay.jpg","hash":"large_peace_x_piece_puzzles_premium_rigid_boxes_flatlay_71f49532ec","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","width":1000,"height":750,"size":121.26,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/large_peace_x_piece_puzzles_premium_rigid_boxes_flatlay_71f49532ec.jpg"},"medium":{"name":"medium_peace-x-piece-puzzles-premium-rigid-boxes-flatlay.jpg","hash":"medium_peace_x_piece_puzzles_premium_rigid_boxes_flatlay_71f49532ec","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","width":750,"height":563,"size":74.15,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/medium_peace_x_piece_puzzles_premium_rigid_boxes_flatlay_71f49532ec.jpg"},"small":{"name":"small_peace-x-piece-puzzles-premium-rigid-boxes-flatlay.jpg","hash":"small_peace_x_piece_puzzles_premium_rigid_boxes_flatlay_71f49532ec","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","width":500,"height":375,"size":37.03,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/small_peace_x_piece_puzzles_premium_rigid_boxes_flatlay_71f49532ec.jpg"}},"hash":"peace_x_piece_puzzles_premium_rigid_boxes_flatlay_71f49532ec","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","size":189.58,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/peace_x_piece_puzzles_premium_rigid_boxes_flatlay_71f49532ec.jpg","previewUrl":null,"provider":"aws-s3","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2022-07-20T04:47:04.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-09T03:51:53.215Z","focalPoint":null}],"items":[{"id":2578,"title":"Quality assurance","content":"From designers and prepress technicians, to operators and quality control inspectors, all parties work in harmony and follow stringent quality control processes to produce high-quality products in every production run.","link":null,"columnCssOverride":null,"imageCssOverride":null,"icon":"check-circle","image":null},{"id":2579,"title":"Packaging engineering","content":"Our team of engineers can help you develop custom packaging structures that optimize material and space, while providing the protection and security your products need in transit.","link":null,"columnCssOverride":null,"imageCssOverride":null,"icon":"pencil-ruler","image":null},{"id":2580,"title":"Scalability \u0026 reliability","content":"Whether you need 500 or 500,000 units produced, our production capacity can scale limitlessly to meet your operational demands.","link":null,"columnCssOverride":null,"imageCssOverride":null,"icon":"boxes","image":null},{"id":2581,"title":"Dedicated account manager","content":"Get priority support, one-on-one expert guidance, and ongoing consulting for current and future business needs.","link":null,"columnCssOverride":null,"imageCssOverride":null,"icon":"handshake","image":null}],"__component":"sections.images"},{"id":236,"title":"Popular custom boxes \u0026 printed packaging solutions","subTitle":null,"contentAlignment":"start","cardContentAlignment":"start","size":"standard","textColor":"default","backgroundColor":"white","cardBackgroundColor":"light","searchable":false,"viewMode":"grid","viewModeToggle":false,"navigationTitle":"Our products","cards":[{"id":1184,"title":"Mailer Boxes","subTitle":null,"content":"Explore PackMojo's range of [custom mailer boxes](/custom-packaging/mailer-boxes/) - the ideal shipping solution for eCommerce \u0026 businesses of any size.","action":"Explore mailers","actionLink":"/custom-packaging/mailer-boxes/","actionType":"primary","categoryHeader":null,"secondaryAction":null,"secondaryActionType":"secondary","secon