ch throughout searching, price, and quality comparison for custom-designed boxes, we decided to go with PackMojo! Communication throughout the process was great, customer service was top-notch, and we have already recommended people to them because I was impressed with everything! Already looking forward to re-ordering!","author":"Simplicity Teas","authorPosition":null,"authorLink":null,"rating":5,"linkTitle":"Read more about Simplicity Teas' journey","linkUrl":"/showcase/mailer-boxes/simplicity-teas/","createdAt":"2021-04-21T07:10:38.000Z","updatedAt":"2025-01-31T05:40:53.603Z","locale":"en","featureImage":{"id":56,"name":"simplicity-teas-corrugated-kraft-mailers.jpeg","alternativeText":"Simplicity Teas Corrugated Kraft Mailer Boxes","caption":"","width":1024,"height":683,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"name":"thumbnail_simplicity-teas-corrugated-kraft-mailers.jpeg","hash":"thumbnail_simplicity_teas_corrugated_kraft_mailers_cc5ed5ac7d","ext":".jpeg","mime":"image/jpeg","width":234,"height":156,"size":7.87,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/thumbnail_simplicity_teas_corrugated_kraft_mailers_cc5ed5ac7d.jpeg"},"large":{"name":"large_simplicity-teas-corrugated-kraft-mailers.jpeg","hash":"large_simplicity_teas_corrugated_kraft_mailers_cc5ed5ac7d","ext":".jpeg","mime":"image/jpeg","width":1000,"height":667,"size":95.83,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/large_simplicity_teas_corrugated_kraft_mailers_cc5ed5ac7d.jpeg"},"medium":{"name":"medium_simplicity-teas-corrugated-kraft-mailers.jpeg","hash":"medium_simplicity_teas_corrugated_kraft_mailers_cc5ed5ac7d","ext":".jpeg","mime":"image/jpeg","width":750,"height":500,"size":58.94,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/medium_simplicity_teas_corrugated_kraft_mailers_cc5ed5ac7d.jpeg"},"small":{"name":"small_simplicity-teas-corrugated-kraft-mailers.jpeg","hash":"small_simplicity_teas_corrugated_kraft_mailers_cc5ed5ac7d","ext":".jpeg","mime":"image/jpeg","width":500,"height":333,"size":28.21,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/small_simplicity_teas_corrugated_kraft_mailers_cc5ed5ac7d.jpeg"}},"hash":"simplicity_teas_corrugated_kraft_mailers_cc5ed5ac7d","ext":".jpeg","mime":"image/jpeg","size":100.92,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/simplicity_teas_corrugated_kraft_mailers_cc5ed5ac7d.jpeg","previewUrl":null,"provider":"aws-s3","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2021-04-14T19:53:04.000Z","updatedAt":"2021-04-14T19:53:04.000Z","focalPoint":null},"product_category":{"id":1,"categoryId":"mailer-boxes","name":"Mailer Boxes","singularName":"Mailer Box","description":"Mailer boxes are the perfect box for eCommerce packaging and shipping. They can be shipped as is and are fully customizable with print inside and out.","moqCustom":"100","moqStandard":"30","sortOrder":"1","type":"packaging","showcaseTitle":"Explore Mailer Boxes","showcaseDescription":"Mailer boxes are the perfect box for eCommerce packaging and shipping. They can be shipped as is and are fully customizable with print inside and out.","createdAt":"2021-04-07T03:21:27.000Z","updatedAt":"2023-04-07T02:14:50.000Z"}},{"id":23,"content":"Working with PackMojo has been such a delight! PackMojo's customer service is EXCELLENT. PackMojo has been very helpful in sourcing the packaging that we need, helping us work through the process and being extremely thorough to avoid costly mistakes. They are very customer-centric and we really appreciate their excellent communication every step of the way.","author":"OVRY™","authorPosition":"","authorLink":null,"rating":5,"linkTitle":"Read more about Ovry's journey","linkUrl":"/showcase/folding-carton-boxes/ovry/","createdAt":"2021-08-06T02:51:11.000Z","updatedAt":"2025-01-31T05:39:01.009Z","locale":"en","featureImage":{"id":561,"name":"ovry-custom-printed-folding-carton-boxes.jpg","alternativeText":"OVRY Custom Printed Folding Carton Boxes","caption":"","width":1213,"height":971,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"name":"thumbnail_ovry-custom-printed-foldin